sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Participant as 👤 Participant
    participant GW as 🔀 API Gateway
    participant ES as 📅 Events Service
    participant RS as 📝 Registrations Service
    participant KF as 📨 Apache Kafka
    participant NS as 🔔 Notifications Service
    participant DB as 🗄️ MongoDB

    Participant->>GW: GET /api/events (Bearer Token)
    GW->>ES: GET /api/events
    ES->>DB: findAll() events
    DB-->>ES: Liste des événements
    ES-->>GW: [Event1, Event2, ...]
    GW-->>Participant: Liste des événements publiés

    Participant->>GW: POST /api/registrations {eventId, participantId}
    GW->>RS: POST /api/registrations

    RS->>ES: Vérifier disponibilité (currentParticipants < maxParticipants)
    ES-->>RS: Événement disponible ✅

    alt Places disponibles
        RS->>DB: save(Registration{status: PENDING})
        DB-->>RS: Registration créée avec ID
        RS->>KF: Publish → topic: registrations.created {eventId, participantId, registrationId}
        RS-->>GW: 201 Created {registration}
        GW-->>Participant: Confirmation inscription PENDING

        par Traitement asynchrone
            KF->>NS: Consume registrations.created
            NS->>NS: Créer Notification EMAIL
            NS->>DB: save(Notification)
            NS-->>Participant: 📧 Email "Inscription en attente de confirmation"

            KF->>ES: Consume registrations.created
            ES->>DB: Incrémenter currentParticipants
        end

        Note over RS, KF: L'organisateur valide l'inscription
        RS->>DB: update(Registration{status: CONFIRMED})
        RS->>KF: Publish → topic: registrations.confirmed
        KF->>NS: Consume registrations.confirmed
        NS-->>Participant: 📧 Email "Inscription confirmée !"

    else Aucune place disponible
        RS->>DB: save(Registration{status: WAITLISTED})
        RS->>KF: Publish → topic: registrations.waitlisted
        RS-->>GW: 201 Created {registration, status: WAITLISTED}
        GW-->>Participant: Mise en liste d'attente
        KF->>NS: Consume registrations.waitlisted
        NS-->>Participant: 📧 Email "Vous êtes sur liste d'attente"
    end
